@lang en

-- A module that declares its language on the first line, as the L4 skills'
-- encodings do. This version has no language-dependent rendering, so the
-- declaration changes nothing; it only has to be read.

GIVEN age IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is adult` IF age GREATER THAN 17

#EVAL `is adult` 18
#EVAL `is adult` 12
